# The Convex deployment is configured by `bunx convex dev`, which writes
# CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT to .env.local (gitignored).
#
# Add server-side secrets your functions need here, then set them on the
# deployment with `bunx convex env set <NAME> <value>`.
#
# Consumers read the deployment URL from their own env:
#   web  -> VITE_CONVEX_URL
#   expo -> EXPO_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL
